## Who it's for

Barbershops, salons, clinics, vets, cafés, cleaning companies and other local businesses that still take bookings, orders or quote requests by phone, email or DM, and copy them into a calendar or spreadsheet at the end of the day.

## What's included

Booking, ordering and quotes, built for the way your business works: your services, your staff, your hours and your prices. You can try working examples first: a [barbershop](/work/kingsway-cuts), a [physio clinic](/work/harbourview-physio), a [vet clinic](/work/maple-paws-vet), a [café](/work/northwind-coffee-ordering) and a [cleaning company](/work/brightside-cleaning-quotes).

- **A "Book now" button on your existing website.** Booking or ordering in a pop-up on WordPress, Shopify, Squarespace, Wix or Webflow, set up with your services, staff and hours. From $300, about 3 days.
- **Your own site with booking built in,** on its own address, plus one extra feature: intake forms, pet records and vaccination reminders, order-ahead with a kitchen screen, or an instant quote calculator with a leads inbox. From $900, about 7 days.
- **Something specific to your business,** like a deposit, a waiting list or a custom intake step. Quoted after a short call, usually about 10 days.

Every option includes an admin that works on a phone, confirmation and reminder messages, and an outbox that shows what each customer was told.

Two AI add-ons work with any of these:

- **A booking receptionist** on your website that answers questions and books from your real open times, in a chat. See the [website support bot](/work/docs-chat).
- **Quote from a photo.** Customers upload a picture of the job, the AI fills in the quote form, and the price still comes from your own price list. See the [cleaning company](/work/brightside-cleaning-quotes).

## How it helps

Customers book at 11 p.m. instead of calling during your busiest hour. Two people can never take the same slot. Reminders go out on their own, forms arrive before the visit, and quote requests land in one inbox with the price the customer saw.

## What I'll ask you for

Your services and prices, who works when, your opening hours, and what you want customers to be told after they book. I set it up, you check it on your phone, and we go live once you're happy.
